      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 5.55,
          "en": "So now with this exploration of sizing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.55,
          "end": 8.61,
          "en": "and constraints out of the way, I wanna get back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.61,
          "end": 11.79,
          "en": "to making this app a bit more responsive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.79,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "And for that, we of course already made sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 16.35,
          "en": "that we have the chart next to the list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.35,
          "end": 18.81,
          "en": "but now I wanna work on this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.81,
          "end": 22.53,
          "en": "Now this actually does also work in landscape mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.53,
          "end": 25.74,
          "en": "but I would say we could use this space a bit better",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.74,
          "end": 28.77,
          "en": "if we are in landscape mode because we, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.77,
          "end": 32.42,
          "en": "don't need this long title row here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.42,
          "end": 35.25,
          "en": "In addition, of course, we have the problem that right now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.25,
          "end": 37.53,
          "en": "if I open my keyboard,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.53,
          "end": 40.74,
          "en": "I actually can't reach the other inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.74,
          "end": 44.4,
          "en": "and that therefore is also something we might want to fix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.4,
          "end": 46.92,
          "en": "It's also the reason why I'm getting an error here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.92,
          "end": 50.16,
          "en": "in Visual Studio Code after opening the keyboard here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.16,
          "end": 53.85,
          "en": "in this landscape view of this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.85,
          "end": 55.65,
          "en": "Now, first of all, let's make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.65,
          "end": 57.63,
          "en": "that we can open this keyboard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.63,
          "end": 60.39,
          "en": "and actually reach all inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.39,
          "end": 63.48,
          "en": "To achieve this, we have to go to new_expense.dart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.48,
          "end": 66.96,
          "en": "because that is in the end where we do render this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.96,
          "end": 71.91,
          "en": "And in the build method of our new expense state class here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.91,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "we can again use MediaQuery.of context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.62,
          "end": 77.97,
          "en": "as we did it before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.97,
          "end": 81.48,
          "en": "but now not to calculate the available width or height,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.48,
          "end": 83.73,
          "en": "at least not yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.73,
          "end": 86.37,
          "en": "But instead on this MediaQuery object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.37,
          "end": 90.033,
          "en": "we can also access a viewInsets object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.2,
          "end": 94.05,
          "en": "And this is an object that contains extra information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.05,
          "end": 96.27000000000001,
          "en": "about UI elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.27000000000001,
          "end": 99.303,
          "en": "that might be overlapping certain parts of the UI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.71000000000001,
          "end": 103.92,
          "en": "For example, if I access viewInsets.bottom here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.92,
          "end": 106.11,
          "en": "I get any extra UI elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.11,
          "end": 109.71000000000001,
          "en": "that are overlapping the UI from the bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.71000000000001,
          "end": 112.14,
          "en": "And that's of course exactly what this keyboard does.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.14,
          "end": 115.503,
          "en": "It slides in from the bottom and over overlaps my UI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.4,
          "end": 119.67,
          "en": "So here with MediaQuery of viewInsets.bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.67,
          "end": 124.053,
          "en": "I can get the amount of space taken up by that keyboard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 128.85,
          "en": "I can then save this in keyboardSpace",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.85,
          "end": 130.62,
          "en": "or whatever you want to name it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.62,
          "end": 134.37,
          "en": "and now we could use that to adjust our padding here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.37,
          "end": 138.39,
          "en": "and actually add more padding from the bottom if this space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.39,
          "end": 140.76,
          "en": "is taken up by the keyboard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.76,
          "end": 142.959,
          "en": "So we could set the bottom padding here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.959,
          "end": 146.82,
          "en": "to keyboard space plus 16 so that we always have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.82,
          "end": 149.43,
          "en": "at least 16 pixels of bottom padding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.43,
          "end": 151.32,
          "en": "but we add that extra space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.32,
          "end": 153.393,
          "en": "that might be taken up by the keyboard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.38,
          "end": 157.53,
          "en": "Now if we do that, we have to remove const though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.53,
          "end": 161.49,
          "en": "since EdgeInsets is now calculated dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.49,
          "end": 163.59,
          "en": "Now, if you do set the padding like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.59,
          "end": 165.12,
          "en": "and you save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.12,
          "end": 167.34,
          "en": "you'll note that nothing changes though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.34,
          "end": 169.8,
          "en": "we still get this error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.8,
          "end": 173.4,
          "en": "The reason for that is that we also must make the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 173.4,
          "end": 177.32999999999998,
          "en": "of this modal sheet, so this widget tree that is returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.32999999999998,
          "end": 179.85,
          "en": "by the new expense widget scrollable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.85,
          "end": 182.1,
          "en": "so that we actually can scroll away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.1,
          "end": 183.69,
          "en": "because if you take a look at the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.69,
          "end": 185.61,
          "en": "of course this must be scrollable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.61,
          "end": 188.313,
          "en": "otherwise we can't reach the other input fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.69,
          "end": 192.33,
          "en": "Therefore, we should wrap this padding widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.33,
          "end": 194.52,
          "en": "with another widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 194.52,
          "end": 196.82999999999998,
          "en": "So I'll choose that refactor action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.82999999999998,
          "end": 199.5,
          "en": "and choose the SingleChildScrollView here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.5,
          "end": 201.9,
          "en": "which you also saw before in the course already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.61,
          "end": 206.97,
          "en": "Now if you do that and you save everything and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.97,
          "end": 209.55,
          "en": "you'll see that this looks much better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.55,
          "end": 213.42000000000002,
          "en": "Now this is scrollable and we can reach all the inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 213.42000000000002,
          "end": 215.01,
          "en": "Of course, it's still not ideal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.01,
          "end": 218.55,
          "en": "but on landscape mode, we'll have to live with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.55,
          "end": 220.92000000000002,
          "en": "because we do have that keyboard there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.92000000000002,
          "end": 222.99,
          "en": "and there is only a limited amount",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 222.99,
          "end": 226.11,
          "en": "of height left thereafter, it is what it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.11,
          "end": 228.36,
          "en": "But now at least this looks better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 228.36,
          "end": 232.07999999999998,
          "en": "Though you will note that if you close the keyboard,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 232.07999999999998,
          "end": 234.99,
          "en": "the modal sheet now actually does not take up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 234.99,
          "end": 238.668,
          "en": "the entire height anymore, and you might be fine with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.668,
          "end": 240.42,
          "en": "but you can also make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.42,
          "end": 243.42,
          "en": "that it does take up the entire height again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 243.42,
          "end": 245.73,
          "en": "By the way, here, I'm still getting an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.73,
          "end": 247.98,
          "en": "that there is some overflow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 247.98,
          "end": 251.04,
          "en": "but this seems to be some weird behavior or bug",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 251.04,
          "end": 254.1,
          "en": "since I can't detect any overflow here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 254.1,
          "end": 257.46,
          "en": "I can reach everything and everything seems to work here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 257.46,
          "end": 260.46,
          "en": "so it looks like this is kind of a buggy error message here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 261.48,
          "end": 263.22,
          "en": "Either way, to make sure that we take up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 263.22,
          "end": 264.66,
          "en": "the entire height again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 264.66,
          "end": 267.42,
          "en": "I'll wrap this SingleChildScrollView",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 267.42,
          "end": 269.22,
          "en": "with another widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 269.22,
          "end": 272.32,
          "en": "I'll wrap it with a SizedBox to be precise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 273.42,
          "end": 276.3,
          "en": "because on that SizedBox, I can set the height",
